163:- `colors` must define all 51 required tokens. `thinkingMax`, `scrollbarThumb`, and the two search highlight tokens are optional and use the fallbacks listed below.
167:## Color Tokens
169:Every theme must define all 51 required color tokens. The optional tokens preserve compatibility with existing themes: `thinkingMax` falls back to `thinkingXhigh`, `scrollbarThumb` and `searchMatchBg` fall back to `selectedBg`, and `searchMatchText` falls back to `text`. Other search matches use `searchMatchText` on `searchMatchBg` with an underline; the current match reverses that foreground/background pair and uses bold text.
